+@startuml donor-variants
+title Donor deployment variants - Draft target: slice 0 one-host MVP precedes donor; A first, B disabled, C sandbox fallback
+left to right direction
+actor "Human donor\nonly init authority; TTY/typed consent\nis a policy heuristic" as O
